WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.640
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start!

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.410
When watching Kaleido Star,
please keep the room brightly lit,

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.000
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.150
I'm Sora Naegino.
I came to America all by myself

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:15.850
with aspirations of joining Kaleido Stage.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:17.620
Everything is new to me,

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:21.120
but I'm doing my best in the spirit of
"try it rather than think about it."

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.490
There's nothing I can't do if I try

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:24.290
and if I can do it without trying,
I'd be super lucky.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.320
And if I'm gonna do it, I just gotta do it!
Gotta! Gotta! That's me.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:32.130
Well, well, well, everyone, are you
really able to tell your feelings

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.330
to your mom and dad?

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:36.870
About stuff like, "This is what I want to do."

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.740
Of course, I know I shouldn't make
my parents worry,

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.740
but I don't want to have any regrets either.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:44.810
I want to tell them how I really feel,
you know?

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.370
You know? You know?

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.630
<i>What is it that you want to do?</i>

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:05.630
<i>Yaritai koto wa nani</i>

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.300
<i>Every time I was asked that</i>

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.300
<i>Sou kikareru tabi</i>

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:13.030
<i>I looked up at the blue sky</i>

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:13.030
<i>Aoi sora miageta</i>

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:17.050
<i>The answer is only in my heart</i>

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:17.050
<i>Kotae wa only my heart</i>

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:24.550
<i>I don't easily say the words
that are really important</i>

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:24.550
<i>Honto ni daiji na kotoba wa
kantan ni wa iwanai</i>

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:31.860
<i>I start running towards the place
the light points to</i>

00:01:24.550 --> 00:01:31.860
<i>Hikari ga yubisasu basho e to hashiridasu yo</i>

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>There's so much in my heart that I want
to embrace, I could cry</i>

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>Dakishimetai mono nara
nakitai hodo mune ni aru</i>

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:46.780
<i>I'll keep painting my way, I promise,
take it someday</i>

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:46.780
<i>Egakitsuzukete yuku kitto
take it someday</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:54.750
<i>Beyond the horizon,
where the white clouds drift</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:54.750
<i>Shiroi kumo ga nagareru
chiheisen no mukou ni</i>

00:01:54.750 --> 00:02:06.530
<i>The future is lined up and
it'll always be there by my side</i>

00:01:54.750 --> 00:02:06.530
<i>Naranderu mirai wa itsumo
soba ni aru kara</i>

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:35.090
"My Amazingly Distant Family"

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.960
My Amazingly Distant Family

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.960
"My Amazingly Distant Family"

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:40.790
My Amazingly Distant Family

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:49.730
The curtain rises in 15 minutes.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.300
Mia, how did your grandma's surgery go?

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:59.050
They called me a little while ago
and said it was successful.

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.120
That's great.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.610
Yeah, thank...

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:04.090
We'll have to give it our best too.

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:05.310
Stop that.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.260
Unless I'm doing something funny,

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.620
I feel like my mind's going to go blank!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:17.070
On the other hand, unlike us,
Sora's already had stage experience,

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:18.290
so she's calm and composed.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.170
Maybe not.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.130
Sora!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:28.570
Miss Sarah...

00:03:29.010 --> 00:03:31.280
The false appearance that
deceives the world.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.680
What?! Did you have to go that far?!
Ouch!

00:03:35.050 --> 00:03:35.220
She's still the same inside.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:37.410
That hurt!

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:37.410
She's still the same inside.

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.070
Excuse me, where is Kaleido Stage?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.260
Kaleido Stage?

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:55.130
Yes...

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.640
Are you Japanese?

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:58.940
Yes.

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:03.980
You're in luck. Today's the day
the world famous star from Japan,

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.710
Sora, is appearing on the stage.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:07.150
Sora will?!

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:09.810
Do you know her?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.740
She's my daughter.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:15.210
Papa!

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:17.290
Pa... Papa?!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.030
The surprises are yet to come.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:22.130
We have just a few more minutes
until the show starts.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.570
Take this time to say your fond farewells
to your humdrum daily life.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.280
We need to make sure we don't
make any mistakes.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.800
Yeah, I know. Let's do it.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:42.180
The seats are packed. Break a leg.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:44.320
Packed?!

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.810
Sorry. Did I make you nervous?

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.750
There's no such thing as a performance
that will not make you nervous.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:56.390
I never realized.
Even Miss Layla gets nervous.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:05:01.190
Don't forget that you guys are just
barely passable.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:02.760
Yes, sir!

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:08.640
You didn't have to go to the trouble
of driving me there...

00:05:08.840 --> 00:05:12.210
Sora and I are friends.
Let me do this for you, Papa.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:45.850
Miss Layla truly is good. She's so composed.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:48.910
After all, she's been through a lots of
opening days already.

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:52.280
Miss Layla really is amazing.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:55.020
She's even livelier than she is at practice.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.950
Being good during the real thing
is what makes you a pro.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.530
When Miss Sarah's song ends,

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.770
it'll be time for you fairy godmothers
to go on stage.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.010
Are you ready?

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:10.940
Yes.

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:17.880
Let's do our best.

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:21.380
We've done everything we can
to be ready for this. Right?

00:06:27.960 --> 00:06:28.980
Let's go!

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.390
Oh, Sora...

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.130
Be confident.

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:41.500
And keep in time with each other.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:42.670
Good!

00:06:43.040 --> 00:06:45.400
Now, it's finally the scene
where we cast the spell.

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:48.100
The Triple Illusion that we worked
the hardest to get right.

00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:01.410
No! I was late.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:02.720
I'm going out!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:03.060
What? But...

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:03.060
I'm going out!

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:03.960
What? But...

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.790
Prepare the smoke and flash!

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.120
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:09.790
Miss Layla!

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:21.700
Miss Layla ad-libbed to cover for us.

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:26.080
Sora!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.910
Excuse me, I can't see!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.020
No, no. Smile, smile.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:39.590
I'm sorry.

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.820
It's because I made a mistake...

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.900
You think the audience will accept
that kind of excuse?

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:55.140
Sora, I'm sorry.
I'm more to blame than you.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:59.210
No, it's my fault for not
being able to respond

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.840
to Miss Layla's ad-lib at all.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:02.980
Sora, you have a guest!

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:03.970
What?

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.150
Sora.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:12.730
Dad!

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.930
What?!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:16.760
Sora's... dad?

00:08:17.130 --> 00:08:20.400
Hey, do you think he came
to take Sora back?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:23.900
He was against her joining Kaleido Stage,
wasn't he?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:26.400
Dad...

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:32.010
Oh, Dad, these are Mia and Anna;
we joined at the same time.

00:08:32.350 --> 00:08:34.250
Thank you for being friends with Sora.

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.010
Uh, hello.

00:08:36.720 --> 00:08:40.120
Why didn't you let me know
you were coming?

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:44.550
Oh, well, I came here on short notice
because of business.

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:46.220
How is Mom?

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:49.390
Oh, she's worried about you.

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:50.790
I see.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.600
Excuse me...

00:08:53.900 --> 00:08:55.200
Dad, this is Ken.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:59.610
It's nice to meet you. Here you are.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.770
Thank you for coming to see me
on stage today.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.210
Even though you saw me
in an awkward situation...

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.850
Oh, this?

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:17.520
I just bumped into something
during practice.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.050
Sora.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:22.690
Oh, no. It's nothing.

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:23.920
Okay...

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.230
Are you going to stay here tonight?

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:28.760
Yeah.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:31.700
I wish I could show you around, but...

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.640
Don't worry.

00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:37.310
Oh, I know. Why don't we go to
the hotel restaurant tonight

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.850
and have a Japanese meal?

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:43.340
Well... But I'm supposed to practice
with Mia and Anna, so...

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.220
I see.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.490
Oh, but come to think of it, I'd like that.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.190
I haven't had Japanese in a while.

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.060
Don't push yourself.

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.430
Then I'll say goodbye here.

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:58.890
Okay.

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:05.770
Oh, Dad! Come to see me tomorrow too!

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.630
I see. So, that is how it is.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:40.870
Your current parents are not
your real parents.

00:10:41.480 --> 00:10:42.880
Oh... Oh!

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.940
Oh, Sora, I think my hair got caught...

00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:49.810
Dad came all this way to see me,
so I'm going to do my best!

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:59.990
Oh, this is terrible!

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.220
This is just totally unacceptable.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.730
Good morning.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.530
What was that about? It wasn't very nice.

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.050
It's a review of yesterday's performance.

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:18.850
What?

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:21.250
"In Kaleido Stage's new production,

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:23.180
Layla's big performance drew
the audience's attention.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:26.620
I appreciate the idea of the fairy
godmother being played by a trio,

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.780
but their mistakes stood out and
their performance was also dull."

00:11:35.400 --> 00:11:37.230
Being written that kind of critique...

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.500
Today's audience members have probably
read that, haven't they?

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.230
Mia, let's pull ourselves together
and do our best.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.770
What are you doing?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.030
Boss!

00:11:49.240 --> 00:11:52.080
What are you doing, being affected
by a newspaper critique?

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:57.940
Just watch, I will cover for any
mistakes that you make.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:06.360
Both Mia and Anna's jumps are smaller
than yesterday.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.500
Hey, those fairy godmothers are the ones

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.900
the newspaper wrote a terrible
review of, right?

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.670
Yes, they are. I feel sorry for Layla.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:18.860
This way, Mr. Naegino.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.680
What are you three doing?!
If you're going to perform like that,

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:24.170
step down from the stage right this minute!

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.310
That is an important scene
where the spell is cast!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.340
I'm very sorry.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.160
I can't believe they have the nerve
to appear on stage like that.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.180
No kidding.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:40.760
Sora.

00:12:43.130 --> 00:12:44.390
I need to talk to you.

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:07.490
Sora, come home.

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.220
What?

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.990
Come back to Japan.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:13.990
Dad?

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:18.590
To tell you the truth, I came to see
how you're doing.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.870
Your mom is also worried about you.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:28.810
She wants me to bring you home if you
seem to be having a hard time.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.070
I should have opposed it more

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:37.510
when you started telling me that you
wanted to join Kaleido Stage.

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:43.150
I should have stopped you no matter what.
Such a dangerous job...

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:49.360
Besides, I don't want to see you
struggle any more than this.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:52.590
Sora, let's go home together.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:57.030
I'm not leaving for Japan until you say
that you're coming with me.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.170
Sora!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:13.380
We came looking for you,
since you were out for so long.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.220
Oh, sorry for making you guys worry.

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.590
So, what did your dad say?

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:19.860
Well...

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:21.150
Sora?

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:26.070
He told me... to come back to Japan.

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:31.070
Sora, you aren't going home, are you? Right?

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:35.570
I don't want to go home!
But I couldn't say that to my dad.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.710
Because... Because...

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:52.480
Starting today, we'll be your mom and dad.

00:14:55.730 --> 00:15:01.330
Back before I was in grade school,
my real mom and dad

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:03.670
were killed in an automobile accident.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:08.500
My current dad is my real dad's cousin.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.350
It's because he's not your real dad that
he's telling you to come home,

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.410
ignoring your feelings.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:17.650
No, you're wrong.

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:21.980
Mom and Dad both raised me
with a lot of care.

00:15:22.590 --> 00:15:24.520
And I really love them too.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.250
That's why I couldn't tell him
that I didn't want to go home.

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:32.190
Why don't you just tell him
your honest feelings?

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.250
Sora! Something terrible happened!
Your dad...

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:58.820
They said your dad collapsed!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:00.550
My dad?

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:05.770
There was a call from the police

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:08.670
and your dad was apparently
taken to Cape Mary Hospital.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:12.330
What'll you do? The evening show's
going to start soon.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.270
We need to be on standby.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:18.540
Oh, Sora!

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:21.740
Sora...

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.640
I'll end up being absent for the performance.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:29.060
They may not forgive me for that.

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:33.890
Even like this, if it were Miss Layla, she
might be able to get on stage as usual.

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:38.900
But though they might say I'm not being
professional, for me...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.000
Dad?!

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:47.470
Dad...

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:49.910
Sora...

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.150
There's nothing to worry about.
Just let him rest.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:56.880
Dad, l...

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:01.080
I think maybe I will go back
to Japan with you.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:02.620
Sora...

00:17:03.590 --> 00:17:07.790
I figured I'd stay near you and Mom after all.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:10.120
Sora...

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:11.720
Dad...

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.140
What is that girl thinking?!

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:18.130
As I said, her dad was...

00:17:18.570 --> 00:17:21.200
It doesn't matter what reason
she might have!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.030
We'll need a substitute for...

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.240
We'll do the show with just
two fairy godmothers.

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.440
Layla, cover for her.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.050
It's already started.

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:51.870
Miss Layla!

00:17:53.270 --> 00:17:54.370
Excuse me!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:56.330
You!

00:17:56.910 --> 00:17:58.280
I'm very sorry.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.440
You think you can get away
with it by apologizing?

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:03.740
I'm...

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:09.650
Going to quit Kaleido Stage.

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:14.020
I'm surprised.

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:17.760
I didn't know you could be clever
and live your life that way.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.800
I wonder if she's serious?

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:29.640
You sound disappointed.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.280
You're kidding me, right, Sora?!

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:39.580
You should really think it over
one more time.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.580
Sorry, but I've already decided.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:45.580
We can't play that part without you.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.530
It's not too late, let's go apologize to
the Boss right now.

00:18:48.900 --> 00:18:51.490
You can do that part even without me.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:56.100
But I'm the only child Mom and Dad have.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:19:00.570
It was fun getting to perform
in Kaleido Stage,

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.800
even if it was only for a short time.

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.920
The Moon. Wavering emotions.

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:28.990
But when the clouds clear,
your indecision will also vanish.

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:36.910
Are you sure you don't need to stay in
the hospital here a little longer?

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:41.580
Since you told me that you would
come home, I got better.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:42.670
I'm glad.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:46.220
Hey, Dad.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:50.320
That was the first time you saw
Kaleido Stage, right?

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.960
How was it? Did you enjoy it?

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:54.850
Yes.

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:58.360
Wasn't Miss Layla amazing? Mr. Yuri too.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:02.060
I can't believe I got to be on stage
with those people.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:06.570
When you said I could go to the audition,

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.910
it made me so happy.

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:12.540
When I told you that I'd been accepted,

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.620
you said, "Congratulations!"

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:17.020
Even at that time...

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:19.780
I was so happy.

00:20:26.930 --> 00:20:32.130
Because I knew that you and Mom
were actually against it.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:37.400
So when you came to see me,
I was really happy.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:42.670
I wish I could've shown you
a better performance, but...

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:44.180
Sora...

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:48.640
I'm sorry. I don't know what to do.

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:52.950
To be honest, I don't want
to quit Kaleido Stage.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:57.550
But I don't want to make you
and Mom worry, either.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:59.690
What should I do?

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:04.330
Sora, I'll go home by myself.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:09.270
But if it gets tough, you can come home
whenever you want.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:13.200
You're our precious daughter, after all.

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:15.770
Dad...

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:18.600
Be careful not to get injured.

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:24.280
Dad!

00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:29.650
Thank you.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:35.090
I'm very sorry!

00:21:35.700 --> 00:21:37.760
I know what I told you yesterday,

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:41.530
but I just love Kaleido Stage.

00:21:42.040 --> 00:21:45.010
So, let me try one more time. Please!

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:48.830
We are not the ones you need
to apologize to.

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:55.510
You're greatly indebted to the audience
who came to see the show.

00:21:56.350 --> 00:21:58.220
Show them your best performance.

00:22:00.150 --> 00:22:01.120
I will!

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:10.160
Someday, I want to be able
to tell my mom and dad

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:13.300
to come to see my performance
with confidence.

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:16.900
Someday, I'll be able to.

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:24.380
<i>When you're lonely, what do you do?</i>

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:24.380
<i>When you sabishii toki doushitemasuka</i>

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>Never say you don't get any of that</i>

00:22:24.380 --> 00:22:26.810
<i>Never say sonna no wakannai</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:29.720
<i>Sleep, play, flip through a magazine</i>

00:22:26.810 --> 00:22:29.720
<i>Nemuru asobu magazine mekuru</i>

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:32.020
<i>When you're lonely, you're lonely</i>

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:32.020
<i>Sabishii toki wa sabishii yo</i>

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:36.820
<i>Like always, invisible vibes fly around
the city today, tulututu</i>

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:36.820
<i>Mienai denpa ga kyou mo
tulututu machi ni tobikau</i>

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:41.500
<i>Anyway, the vector of my heart is
talking about so many reasons</i>

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:41.500
<i>Anyway kokoro no bekutoru
so many reason hanashiteru</i>

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:46.170
<i>I want to be free and fly the skies</i>

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:46.170
<i>Jiyuu ni sora o tobitai keredo</i>

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:50.870
<i>But I don't have space to spread my wings</i>

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:50.870
<i>Hane o hirogeru basho ga nai</i>

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:53.040
<i>But I have faith</i>

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:53.040
<i>Demo shinjiteru</i>

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>There is a future yet to be shaped</i>

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Katachi no nai mirai ga aru yo</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:02.380
<i>And there's a me that I want to shape</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:02.380
<i>Katachi ni shitai watashi ga iru</i>

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>Even if I'm sad, even if it's a mistake</i>

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:08.860
<i>Kanashikutemo machigai demo</i>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:14.230
<i>I'll do what I want and
fly towards the freedom</i>

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:14.230
<i>Omou mama fly to the free</i>

00:23:20.230 --> 00:23:22.030
Next Kaleido Star

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:25.910
And so, I brought home a seal.

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:26.810
What?

00:23:26.810 --> 00:23:28.040
His name is Jonathan!

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:30.440
But I heard we're not allowed
to keep any pets here.

00:23:30.440 --> 00:23:32.250
You say you'll take care of it yourself,

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:33.280
but there's the cost of feeding him too.

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:36.520
All right! In that case, the three of us
will enter a juggling contest

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:37.820
and aim for victory.

00:23:37.820 --> 00:23:38.250
Yeah!

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:38.850
Yeah!

00:23:38.250 --> 00:23:38.850
Yeah!

00:23:38.850 --> 00:23:39.290
Yeah!

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:42.960
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Seal"

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:43.560
The Amazing Seal

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:43.560
Next time on Kaleido Star,
"The Amazing Seal"

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:45.690
The Amazing Seal

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:45.690
My wings are my dream
and on towards the sky...

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:47.790
The Amazing Seal
